atus":"success"}},{"id":"37a42080-ed20-4215-ba98-39577edfc668","type":"image","title":"直播间场景","position":{"x":4512,"y":1469.2081569226696},"width":350,"height":467,"parentId":"0536e3c0-b04e-4118-84c8-e4529229f2bc","metadata":{"content":"https://libtv-res.liblib.art/sd-gen-save-img/genius_playground/image/9c9ca63a3fd948e8abb9ab96ade97321/05b8882cd62e3e5e513f24def12afbd3ea9932768c503641a456c22e4b630ffb.png","status":"success","naturalWidth":1440,"naturalHeight":1920,"size":"1776x2368","quality":"medium","count":4,"ltvExecutionContract":"openai-image","strictGenerationOptions":["model","size","quality","count"],"generationMode":"image","prompt":"鼠标尺寸在场景中显示的合理，同时需要支架装置立起鼠标，而不是凭空悬浮","composerContent":"鼠标尺寸在场景中显示的合理，同时需要支架装置立起鼠标，而不是凭空悬浮","model":"","ltvReferencePlan":{"prompt":"鼠标尺寸在场景中显示的合理，同时需要支架装置立起鼠标，而不是凭空悬浮","references":[{"nodeId":"3b6a19d6-a7b1-4726-9575-1414e7d270fc","url":"","kind":"image","deferred":true},{"nodeId":"68fd026d-e5f7-4a64-8080-087c77480d8d","url":"","kind":"image","deferred":true}],"texts":[{"nodeId":"6e059fb8-c62f-4cbe-a223-7e88c22d32fa","content":"- **整体设计风格 (Overall Aesthetic)：**\\\n  **高阶极简与建筑空间美学 (Advanced Minimalism & Architectural Space)**。摒弃了传统直播间繁杂的背景与装饰，采用类似现代高端美术馆或Apple Store的陈列逻辑。大量使用干净的几何线条（如圆柱体展台、巨大的圆形顶灯、利落的平直线条），强调材质的哑光质感与空间的呼吸感，传递出专业、纯粹、克制的高端科技品牌调性。\n\n- **空间布局与排版 (Spatial Layout & Composition)：**\\\n  **严格的中轴对称式构图 (Strict Central Axis Symmetry)**。\n\n  - **视觉锚点：** 画面以绝对居中的立柱发光带和正前方的几何展台构成强烈的中心视觉锚点，确保直播时的焦点完全锁定在主播与核心产品上。\n\n  - **两侧留白：** 左右两侧墙面采用大面积留白（负空间），仅辅以对称的极简悬浮一字隔板，形成视觉上的平衡与延伸。\n\n  - **纵深层级：** 通过“顶部环形灯带 - 背景发光立柱 - 前景立体展台”构建出清晰的Z轴空间景深，使平面的直播画面具有建筑级的立体感。\n\n- **色调与光影配色 (Color Palette & Lighting Tone)：**\\\n  **低饱和暖调中性色与漫反射光影 (Low-saturation Warm Neutrals & Diffuse Lighting)**。\n\n  - **色彩基调：** 整体摒弃了科技行业常见的暗黑或高饱和霓虹色，转而采用大面积的**暖灰色 (Warm Grey)、米白色 (Off-White) 与砂岩色 (Sandstone)**。这种低饱和的单色调（Monochromatic）营造出一种治愈、高级且不喧宾夺主的背景氛围。\n\n  - **光影设计：** 核心采用**无主灯设计的漫反射环境光 (Ambient Diffuse Light)**。利用背景的隐藏式发光带（柔和的奶油暖光）和顶部的洗墙灯，消除了生硬的物理阴影。品牌标识与核心区域采用自发光设计，以光线代替实体制轮廓，呈现出轻盈的未来科技质感。"}]}}},{"id":"37a42080-ed20-4215-ba98-39577edfc668::saved::1","type":"image","title":"直播间场景 · 版本 2","position":{"x":4894,"y":1469.2081569226696},"width":350,"height":467,"parentId":"0536e3c0-b04e-4118-84c8-e4529229f2bc","metadata":{"content":"https://libtv-res.liblib.art/sd-gen-save-img/genius_playground/image/9c9ca63a3fd948e8abb9ab96ade97321/63de8e341ecc76bfd2738f6f26098879ca352e0763c46aa7285b261df6c2e9ba.png","status":"success"}},{"id":"37a42080-ed20-4215-ba98-39577edfc668::saved::2","type":"image","title":"直播间场景 · 版本 3","position":{"x":5276,"y":1469.2081569226696},"width":350,"height":467,"parentId":"0536e3c0-b04e-4118-84c8-e4529229f2bc","metadata":{"content":"https://libtv-res.liblib.art/sd-gen-save-img/genius_playground/image/9c9ca63a3fd948e8abb9ab96ade97321/1615a8113f0dc5dd602616c0d0a9ca3de5175c8a54e06c2fa5731afd8e672c70.png","status":"success"}},{"id":"37a42080-ed20-4215-ba98-39577edfc668::saved::3","type":"image","title":"直播间场景 · 版本 4","position":{"x":5658,"y":1469.2081569226696},"width":350,"height":467,"parentId":"0536e3c0-b04e-4118-84c8-e4529229f2bc","metadata":{"content":"https://libtv-res.liblib.art/sd-gen-save-img/genius_playground/image/9c9ca63a3fd948e8abb9ab96ade97321/adf0b407dcba7850357ff6644b8938ed25d6a358b29580c415991a967246744f.png","status":"success"}},{"id":"6e059fb8-c62f-4cbe-a223-7e88c22d32fa","type":"text","title":"直播间风格提示词","position":{"x":3788.983997040699,"y":1471.2081569226696},"width":627,"height":467,"parentId":"0536e3c0-b04e-4118-84c8-e4529229f2bc","metadata":{"content":"- **整体设计风格 (Overall Aesthetic)：**\\\n  **高阶极简与建筑空间美学 (Advanced Minimalism & Architectural Space)**。摒弃了传统直播间繁杂的背景与装饰，采用类似现代高端美术馆或Apple Store的陈列逻辑。大量使用干净的几何线条（如圆柱体展台、巨大的圆形顶灯、利落的平直线条），强调材质的哑光质感与空间的呼吸感，传递出专业、纯粹、克制的高端科技品牌调性。\n\n- **空间布局与排版 (Spatial Layout & Composition)：**\\\n  **严格的中轴对称式构图 (Strict Central Axis Symmetry)**。\n\n  - **视觉锚点：** 画面以绝对居中的立柱发光带和正前方的几何展台构成强烈的中心视觉锚点，确保直播时的焦点完全锁定在主播与核心产品上。\n\n  - **两侧留白：** 左右两侧墙面采用大面积留白（负空间），仅辅以对称的极简悬浮一字隔板，形成视觉上的平衡与延伸。\n\n  - **纵深层级：** 通过“顶部环形灯带 - 背景发光立柱 - 前景立体展台”构建出清晰的Z轴空间景深，使平面的直播画面具有建筑级的立体感。\n\n- **色调与光影配色 (Color Palette & Lighting Tone)：**\\\n  **低饱和暖调中性色与漫反射光影 (Low-saturation Warm Neutrals & Diffuse Lighting)**。\n\n  - **色彩基调：** 整体摒弃了科技行业常见的暗黑或高饱和霓虹色，转而采用大面积的**暖灰色 (Warm Grey)、米白色 (Off-White) 与砂岩色 (Sandstone)**。这种低饱和的单色调（Monochromatic）营造出一种治愈、高级且不喧宾夺主的背景氛围。\n\n  - **光影设计：** 核心采用**无主灯设计的漫反射环境光 (Ambient Diffuse Light)**。利用背景的隐藏式发光带（柔和的奶油暖光）和顶部的洗墙灯，消除了生硬的物理阴影。品牌标识与核心区域采用自发光设计，以光线代替实体制轮廓，呈现出轻盈的未来科技质感。","status":"success"}},{"id":"9151405f-b48e-4f56-9e35-ebd4a49a05fb","type":"image","title":"海报（横板）","position":{"x":4773.370110530313,"y":645.188670780343},"width":618,"height":350,"parentId":"0536e3c0-b04e-4118-84c8-e4529229f2bc","metadata":{"content":"https://libtv-res.liblib.art/sd-gen-save-img/genius_playground/image/9c9ca63a3fd948e8abb9ab96ade97321/8f6b573eb19dfc051185cbb643c7033c5e4ee6d28e7cdf34bfc38249eccf7018.png","status":"success","naturalWidth":1920,"naturalHeight":1088,"size":"2816x1584","quality":"medium","count":1,"ltvExecutionContract":"openai-image","strictGenerationOptions":["model","size","quality","count"],"generationMode":"image","prompt":"生成横板海报","composerContent":"生成横板海报","model":"","ltvReferencePlan":{"prompt":"生成横板海报","references":[{"nodeId":"39dc0141-e002-4b2d-abb6-5b54502d7d68","url":"","kind":"image","deferred":true},{"nodeId":"3b6a19d6-a7b1-4726-9575-1414e7d270fc","url":"","kind":"image","deferred":true}],"texts":[]}}},{"id":"5cc60ded-e618-44dc-a469-f6b0e8a1c8b7","type":"text","title":"标题","position":{"x":3788.983997040699,"y":1306.7387045304597},"width":1612,"height":100,"parentId":"0536e3c0-b04e-4118-84c8-e4529229f2bc","metadata":{"content":"# *03*-产品直播间场景设计&直播截图","status":"success"}},{"id":"39dc0141-e002-4b2d-abb6-5b54502d7d68","type":"image","title":"海报（竖版）","position":{"x":4320,"y":645.188670780343},"width":350,"height":467,"parentId":"0536e3c0-b04e-4118-84c8-e4529229f2bc","metadata":{"content":"https://libtv-res.liblib.art/sd-gen-save-img/genius_playground/image/9c9ca63a3fd948e8abb9ab96ade97321/003c89500ebc5d11ffdd54b204fbb73cd45789fc925e3fb23adf64bf80b70cf7.png","status":"success","naturalWidth":1440,"naturalHeight":1920,"size":"1776x2368","quality":"medium","count":4,"ltvExecutionContract":"openai-image","strictGenerationOptions":["model","size","quality","count"],"generationMode":"image","prompt":"产品名称AURORA M1，品牌名称为AURORA，logo可参考图2中部分元素","composerContent":"产品名称AURORA M1，品牌名称为AURORA，logo可参考图2中部分元素","model":"","ltvReferencePlan":{"prompt":"产品名称AURORA M1，品牌名称为AURORA，logo可参考图2中部分元素","references":[{"nodeId":"68fd026d-e5f7-4a64-8080-087c77480d8d","url":"","kind":"image","deferred":true},{"nodeId":"87e4e4e9-9e54-4013-9e93-b94f653b5100","url":"","kind":"image","deferred":true},{"nodeId":"3b6a19d6-a7b1-4726-9575-1414e7d270fc","url":"","kind":"image","deferred":true}],"texts":[{"nodeId":"9a941bf6-35c4-4231-84eb-d144438320ff","content":"- **设计风格 (Overall Aesthetic)：**\\\n  **暗黑空间与光影美学 (Dark Space & Light Art)**。摒弃繁杂背景，利用强烈的聚光灯、星环发光或地平线光晕营造深邃的“失重悬浮感”与“无限空间感”，突出产品的几何雕塑感与未来科技属性。\n\n- **排版布局 (Layout & Typography)：**\\\n  **严格的中轴对称式构图 (Vertical Symmetry)**。采用“上文下图”结构：顶部居中排布无衬线体（Sans-serif）主副标题，字号对比强烈；画面中下部作为核心视觉区，产品呈悬浮或仰视姿态拔地而起。留黑（负空间）极大，视线高度聚焦于产品主体与核心光影。\n\n- **色调配色 (Color Palette & Tone)：**\\\n  整体基调为**深邃冷峻的曜石黑/深空灰 (Obsidian Black/Space Grey)**。以高对比度的\\*\\*冷色发光（如冰川蓝、霓虹青）**或**高饱和暖光（日落金、晨曦橙）\\*\\*作为环境渲染与产品轮廓光（Rim Light），形成极致的明暗冲突（Chiaroscuro），极具电影级的高级质感与能量爆发感。"}]}}},{"id":"39dc0141-e002-4b2d-abb6-5b54502d7d68::saved::1","type":"image","title":"海报（竖版） · 版本 2","position":{"x":4702,"y":645.188670780343},"width":350,"height":467,"parentId":"0536e3c0-b04e-4118-84c8-e4529229f2bc","metadata":{"content":"https://libtv-res.liblib.art/sd-gen-save-img/genius_playground/image/9c9ca63a3fd948e8abb9ab96ade97321/d240e9a4f1f30472b21d9724bea8e0e51d131cb9cd419460df7b11b967cdb350.png","status":"success"}},{"id":"39dc0141-e002-4b2d-abb6-5b54502d7d68::saved::2","type":"image","title":"海报（竖版） · 版本 3","position":{"x":5084,"y":6